Package: q2r
Title: R Interface to the pampa Quarto Parser
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "cr173@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exploratory R bindings to the pampa Rust crate from the
    quarto-dev/q2 project. Parses QMD text or files and returns the
    tree-sitter concrete syntax tree, parse diagnostics, and the Pandoc
    AST in native format.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rundel/q2r, https://rundel.github.io/q2r/
BugReports: https://github.com/rundel/q2r/issues
